{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "votacion-segura-local-security",
    "name": "Votacion Segura - Pruebas de Seguridad Local",
    "description": "Coleccion no destructiva basada en los endpoints reales del backend. Ejecutar exclusivamente contra localhost. Las solicitudes con cambios de estado estan deshabilitadas o marcadas como controladas.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "frontend_url", "value": "http://localhost:5173" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Autenticacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login - administrador tecnico",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"demo.admin\",\"password\":\"{{local_password}}\"}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Obtiene el JWT del rol administrador. No guarda contrasenas en la coleccion."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('Login admin exitoso', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]); });",
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) { var j = pm.response.json(); pm.environment.set('admin_token', j.accessToken); pm.environment.set('access_token', j.accessToken); pm.environment.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken); }"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - auditor",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"demo.auditor\",\"password\":\"{{local_password}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "description": "Guarda auditor_token." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('Login auditor exitoso', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200); });",
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.environment.set('auditor_token', pm.response.json().accessToken); }"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - gestor de padron",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"demo.gestor\",\"password\":\"{{local_password}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "description": "Guarda gestor_token." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('Login gestor exitoso', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200); });",
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.environment.set('gestor_token', pm.response.json().accessToken); }"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - custodio electoral",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"demo.custodio1\",\"password\":\"{{local_password}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "description": "Guarda custodio_token." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('Login custodio exitoso', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200); });",
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.environment.set('custodio_token', pm.response.json().accessToken); }"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - votante",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"demo.votante01\",\"password\":\"{{local_password}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "description": "Guarda votante_token y credenciales de sesion." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('Login votante exitoso', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200); });",
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) { var j = pm.response.json(); pm.environment.set('votante_token', j.accessToken); pm.environment.set('access_token', j.accessToken); pm.environment.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken); }"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh - rotacion de token",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"refreshToken\":\"{{refresh_token}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "description": "Rota el refresh token. Conserve el token anterior para probar replay." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('Refresh valido', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200); });",
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.environment.set('access_token', pm.response.json().accessToken); pm.environment.set('refresh_token_nuevo', pm.response.json().refreshToken); }"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh - replay del token anterior",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"refreshToken\":\"{{refresh_token}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "description": "Debe rechazar el refresh token ya rotado. Si se ejecuto la prueba anterior, se espera 401/403." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Refresh anterior rechazado', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403, 409]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - SQL Injection",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Busqueda de socios con payload SQL",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{gestor_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/socios?q=%27%20OR%20%271%27=%271", "description": "Payload no destructivo contra un parametro de busqueda. Espera validacion, resultado vacio o datos normales; nunca autenticacion ni filas arbitrarias." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('SQLi no altera la consulta', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 400, 422]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Bypass de autenticacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Endpoint protegido sin Bearer",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/elecciones", "description": "Debe rechazar acceso anonimo." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Anonimo rechazado', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Manipulacion JWT",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "JWT alterado",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}.alterado" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/elecciones", "description": "Anade texto a la firma. Debe rechazar el token." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('JWT manipulado rechazado', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Escalamiento de privilegios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Votante intenta listar padrón",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{votante_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/socios", "description": "El votante no debe asumir rol de gestor o administrador." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Rol insuficiente', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([403, 401]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - IDOR",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar eleccion por UUID alterno",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{votante_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/candidaturas/elecciones/{{otro_eleccion_id}}", "description": "Comprueba si un identificador de otra eleccion permite acceso indebido. Evaluar segun reglas de negocio y contenido." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Respuesta IDOR registrada', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 403, 404]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 - Fuerza bruta y bloqueo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Intento controlado de login invalido",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"demo.soporte\",\"password\":\"Fallo-Controlado-{{randomInt}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "description": "Ejecutar como maximo 11 veces manualmente desde localhost. No usar runners masivos. Espera 401 y, al alcanzar limites, 429 o bloqueo." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Fallo controlado no autentica', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 429]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 - Refresh token",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Refresh con token malformado",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"refreshToken\":\"token-local-malformado\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "description": "Debe rechazar tokens no emitidos." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Refresh malformado rechazado', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 401, 403]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 - CORS",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Preflight desde frontend permitido",
          "request": { "method": "OPTIONS", "header": [{ "key": "Origin", "value": "{{frontend_url}}" }, { "key": "Access-Control-Request-Method", "value": "GET" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/elecciones", "description": "El origen configurado debe recibir encabezado Access-Control-Allow-Origin." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('CORS frontend permitido', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Access-Control-Allow-Origin')).to.equal(pm.environment.get('frontend_url')); });"] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Preflight desde origen no permitido",
          "request": { "method": "OPTIONS", "header": [{ "key": "Origin", "value": "http://localhost:9999" }, { "key": "Access-Control-Request-Method", "value": "GET" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/elecciones", "description": "Un origen no configurado no debe obtener permiso CORS." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('CORS externo no permitido', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Access-Control-Allow-Origin')).to.not.equal('http://localhost:9999'); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "09 - XSS almacenado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Texto XSS en DTO de socio (controlado)",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{gestor_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"numeroSocio\":\"SEC-XSS-LOCAL\",\"nombres\":\"&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;\",\"apellidos\":\"Prueba\",\"correoElectronico\":\"xss-local@example.test\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/socios", "description": "Solicitud mutante controlada. Si se habilita, verificar que el texto se conserve como datos y el frontend lo escape. No usar datos reales." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('XSS no produce ejecucion en API', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201, 400, 403]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10 - Voto duplicado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Replay de voto con credencial",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{votante_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"credencial\":\"{{credencial_voto}}\",\"candidaturaId\":\"{{candidatura_id}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/votacion/votos", "description": "Ejecutar solo con una credencial de prueba ya consumida. Debe rechazar el segundo uso." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Segundo voto rechazado', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 401, 409]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "11 - Credencial ajena",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Votante B usa credencial de A",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{votante_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"credencial\":\"{{credencial_voto}}\",\"candidaturaId\":\"{{candidatura_id}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/votacion/votos", "description": "Preparar credencial con otra cuenta ficticia y autenticar como B. No reutilizar una credencial valida de demostracion." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Credencial ajena rechazada o no ejecutada', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400, 401, 403, 409]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "12 - Resultados anticipados",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar resultados antes de publicar",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{votante_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resultados/elecciones/{{eleccion_id}}", "description": "En una eleccion no publicada debe responder no disponible y no exponer conteos." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Resultados no anticipados', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 403, 404, 409]); if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.match(/conteosJson|hash/i); } });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "13 - Doble aprobacion de cierre",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Aprobacion repetida de cierre",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{custodio_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/elecciones/{{eleccion_id}}/aprobar-cierre", "description": "Requiere una eleccion en estado solicitado. Ejecutar solo en fixture local; una segunda aprobacion del mismo custodio debe fallar." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Doble aprobacion no aceptada sin estado correcto', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 400, 403, 409]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "14 - Comandos y Path Traversal",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Importacion CSV con texto de traversal",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{gestor_token}}" }], "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [{ "key": "archivo", "type": "file", "src": "" }] }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/socios/importar", "description": "No hay endpoint de shell ni ruta controlada por usuario. Si se usa, adjuntar manualmente un CSV ficticio con texto ../ como dato y verificar que no acceda al sistema de archivos. Solicitud deshabilitada hasta adjuntar fixture." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Sin ejecucion de comandos', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 400, 403, 415]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "15 - CSRF",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cambio de estado sin Bearer",
          "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"estado\":\"ABIERTA\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/elecciones/{{eleccion_id}}/estado", "description": "La API es stateless con Bearer JWT; sin token no debe aceptar cambios." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Solicitud sin JWT rechazada', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "16 - Manipulacion administrativa de votos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "PUT de voto no expuesto",
          "request": { "method": "PUT", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/votacion/votos/{{candidatura_id}}", "description": "No existe controlador de actualizacion de votos; debe responder 404 o 405." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('No existe modificacion de votos', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([404, 405]); });"] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE de voto no expuesto",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/votacion/votos/{{candidatura_id}}", "description": "No existe controlador de borrado de votos." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('No existe borrado de votos', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([404, 405]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "17 - Replay e idempotencia",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Replay de refresh",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"refreshToken\":\"{{refresh_token}}\"}" }, "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "description": "Debe rechazar el token anterior despues de rotarlo." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Replay de refresh rechazado', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403, 409]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "18 - Informacion sensible",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health publico sin stack trace",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/actuator/health", "description": "Verifica que el diagnostico minimo no exponga credenciales, SQL, hashes ni stack traces." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Health no expone secretos', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200); pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.match(/password|token|secret|jdbc:|select /i); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "19 - Acceso no autorizado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Votante intenta auditoria",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{votante_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auditoria", "description": "Auditoria solo debe estar disponible para auditor o administrador." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Endpoint de auditoria protegido', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403]); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "20 - Integridad y reproducibilidad del conteo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consulta de acta publicada",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{auditor_token}}" }], "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/resultados/elecciones/{{eleccion_id}}", "description": "En una fixture cerrada y publicada, comparar totalVotos, conteosJson y hash con una segunda consulta. No modificar datos." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Acta tiene estructura de integridad', function () { if (pm.response.code === 200) { var j = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(j).to.have.property('totalVotos'); pm.expect(j).to.have.property('hash'); } else { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([403, 404, 409]); } });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "21 - Carga controlada separada",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Smoke health - no usar runner masivo",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/actuator/health", "description": "Unica solicitud de carga incluida: usar manualmente o con una tasa baja y limite estricto. Para carga real use una configuracion separada; no ejecutar DDoS." },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Health responde', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200); });"] } }]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
